cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this development branch by repository commit; the listed DOI is the historical v1.0.0 artifact, not this revision."
title: "MOESI-D: Acknowledged Home-Cache Reductions with Persistent Read Retention"
abstract: >-
  Experimental gem5 implementation of explicit no-return ADD32/ADD64 operations
  executed at the home L2 cache, with acknowledged completion, pre-acceptance
  NACK with ordinary MOESI fallback, optional bank-side combining, and an
  optional L2-local read-retention policy. Includes same-binary ablations
  against the conventional ownership path on a 4-core gem5 model.
authors:
